<description>&lt;p&gt;Separatist leader Lucas Ayaba pleaded not guilty at a war-crimes trial in Norway, showing continued international legal attention to the Anglophone conflict. Boko Haram insurgents have reappeared in northern Cameroon, adding a new security threat to the region. In a remote national park, elephants killed a Swiss tourist and wounded a British and an American hiker, forcing other hikers to hide in tree stumps. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikAFBVV95cUxOTDFUY1d4ckEzdHFEY0RBWlQ1cHpKRml0N1k1aGl6MmYtdV9XRU00SUpOZ3VzSExqdWZDWDNEV2tROGVsM1hOMXBXYnUtRXpzQ3lLc0VRcWNXMVNtbjl2Y0FVbGV4RWwyS2VQWEVwSFU2ZndsRGJ0NWNsYUtmLWRHTWVRX0EyU3lYSWZ3R3owZGo?oc=5&quot;&gt;ITIJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE5leUtOdXVZT3dBVkVpTGdhN1pMWTA5b2JRNVJSbmd2Tm15a2QtMUtkMERlWThINDBGaDhiMFEzRjNPR2ttODdrRGRFV3dwaVc5SkxFbUlYcTROUU8za1djb0RNY0U0Rnk0VmVHOUpR?oc=5&quot;&gt;news.sbs.co.kr&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxQbUg3X2xpLW9XQ3NPMFZVSC11Vm1hWXliNUtnb1VVNV96S0JpMDN1UDl0UGJPN3JPWF83c1lNNE51WDROdm50LXBsWm1ScjhKS05rSHJhbEY4dk02ZDNkWno2alZucEs0TWtKcUNkZVN0by1mZlhqQ3RUaURISHpEN21JeFI2a1VZSkV2OXV1YXpmeUN3bTlTUWU1eW1mUGZCVWE4S25OTndKNlRwY1BiaFBSdmI0M1BPUmlmVWp3Mk95dV9WYUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nacionale&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPUWpVcC1VZ19xYkdvdHpGRlZPMV9YMmtKdjV0d1VBTTFhbHNQbVF2eS02NmY3bUNFVHo4SjlWclVKVzRzeWlVRzE5T3I3cGJIRl9oZnVTMTltSjlfOVdBWWJXYWhzcFJHTkxORTg4YjZESTVYQlRaLVBTN2VNTU1jajFhcTlXUEc4c2FSUTFfOU9ISXJSUWhVMllsTmJKV09TRTRWUVI1dW1jQmRHRzF6RFRELVlkWnpLeUZReFFNU0c0b2hHQVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Geo News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https: